          "message": {
            "text": "Project content is embedded in the initial HTML only after escaping every less-than sign and JavaScript line separator. A narrative title can legitimately contain closing-script text; emitting raw JSON here would let that data terminate the bootstrap script. The server test loads exactly that adversarial title and proves it remains escaped.",
            "markdown": "Project content is embedded in the initial HTML only after escaping every less-than sign and JavaScript line separator. A narrative title can legitimately contain closing-script text; emitting raw JSON here would let that data terminate the bootstrap script. The server test loads exactly that adversarial title and proves it remains escaped."
          },
